#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_ValerieIntro"
msgid ""
"When I'm here…\n"
"A curious power flows into me…$"
msgstr ""
"待在这里的时候……\n"
"就有一股奇妙的力量流进我体内……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:34
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_ValerieDefeat"
msgid "The power is ebbing away…$"
msgstr "力量正在渐渐消退……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_ValeriePostBattle"
msgid ""
"Perhaps the power is from the spirits\n"
"of POKéMON in fitful sleep here…$"
msgstr ""
"也许那股力量来自\n"
"在这里不安地沉睡的宝可梦的灵魂……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_ValerieRegister"
msgid ""
"Fufufu… I lost the match, but…\n"
"I have this little ability…\p"
"Without ever laying my hands on\n"
"your POKéNAV… Hiyah!$"
msgstr ""
"呼呼呼……虽然比赛输了……\n"
"但我有一种小小的能力……\p"
"不用碰你的宝可梦导航……\n"
"嘿呀！$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:47
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_ValerieRematchIntro"
msgid ""
"Behind you…\n"
"What is it…$"
msgstr ""
"你的身后……\n"
"那是什么……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:51
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_ValerieRematchDefeat"
msgid "Something faded away…$"
msgstr "有什么东西消失了……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:54
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_ValeriePostRematch"
msgid ""
"The POKéMON at rest here…\n"
"Sometimes, they play…$"
msgstr ""
"在这里安息的宝可梦们……\n"
"有时候会出来玩耍……$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_CedricIntro"
msgid ""
"Have you lost your bearings?\n"
"Have no fear for I am here!$"
msgstr ""
"你迷路了吗？\n"
"别害怕，有我在！$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_CedricDefeat"
msgid "Weren't you lost?$"
msgstr "你不是迷路了吗？$"

#: data/maps/MtPyre_6F/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "MtPyre_6F_Text_CedricPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I had this feeling that a lost TRAINER\n"
"would be panicked and easy to beat.\p"
"It's dirty and I won't try it again…$"
msgstr ""
"我以为迷路的训练家会惊慌失措，\n"
"很容易打败。\p"
"这招太卑鄙了，我不会再用了……$"
